       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. EVALGRADE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 SCORE PIC 999 VALUE 85.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN SCORE >= 90 DISPLAY "A"
               WHEN SCORE >= 80 DISPLAY "B"
               WHEN OTHER DISPLAY "C"
           END-EVALUATE.
           STOP RUN.
